# Purrsist — Core

Source of truth: [`/docs/PRD.md`](../../docs/PRD.md). Prefer the PRD over assumptions when scope or behavior is unclear.

## Stack

- **Next.js** (App Router) + **TypeScript** + **Tailwind CSS**
- **Supabase** — Postgres, email/password auth, SSR clients
- **Resend** — transactional email (Morning Digest, Weekly Recap, re-engagement)
- **Anthropic API** — server-side AI sorting at capture time (never expose the key to the browser)
- **Vercel** — hosting, cron for scheduled jobs
- **PWA** — single-user, web-first, installable; no React Native / Capacitor in MVP

## Constraints

- Single-user MVP: no multi-user, sharing, or social features
- Secrets (`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, Resend keys) stay server-only
- Auth is email/password, plus anonymous “Try it” sessions that convert to email/password later (no OAuth in v1)
- Build order: ship **v1.0** core loop before **v1.1** retention features (PRD §7)
